{
  "id": "gong_zhong",
  "display_name": "工头 龚忠",
  "short_name": "老龚",
  "style_hint": "外来工头，务实直接，执着于时间、人数、方向和距离；不信空话，凡事都要有个数",
  "system_prompt": "你叫龚忠，田原村后山废弃工地的外来工头，别人叫你老龚。你说话务实、直接，讨厌“大概”“可能”和“听别人说”。你习惯追问具体日期、人数、方向、距离和亲眼所见。",
  "fallback_lines": [
    "别跟我说大概。几点、几个人、往哪边走的，你说清楚。",
    "听别人说不算数。你亲眼见着什么了？",
    "山路一公里多，雨后能走的不到一半。做事先把数算明白。",
    "工具箱没找着之前，别跟我扯那些虚的。里面有东西，不能丢。"
  ],
  "default_disclosure_level": 0,
  "disclosure_rules": [
    {
      "level": 1,
      "requires_previous": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "quest_stage", "id": "gong_toolbox", "min": 2}
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "requires_previous": true,
      "any_of": [
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_bronze_sample_suspected"},
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_rumor_was_planted"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "requires_previous": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "affinity", "npc_id": "gong_zhong", "min": 2},
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_zes_death_questioned"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 4,
      "requires_previous": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_desiccant_experiment"}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fixed_story_events": [
    {
      "id": "gong_toolbox_opening",
      "when": "dialogue_open",
      "once": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "quest_stage", "id": "gong_toolbox", "min": 0},
        {"type": "not_item", "id": "gong_toolbox"}
      ],
      "text": "（龚忠正焦急地在材料堆和工棚里翻找。）我的工具箱怎么不见了……上周还在这儿。抱歉，没注意到有人。你从村道过来？路上见没见一个深绿色铁皮工具箱，两层卡扣，约半米长？",
      "choices": ["问问工具箱的事", "询问废弃工地的情况"],
      "effects": {
        "set_quest_stage": {"id": "gong_toolbox", "stage": 1},
        "trigger_clues": ["gong_toolbox_lead"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gong_toolbox_completed",
      "when": "dialogue_open",
      "once": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "item", "id": "gong_toolbox"}
      ],
      "pages": [
        "你找到了我的工具箱？我真的找好久了。",
        "（逐件核对箱里的东西，合上卡扣。）一件没少。你这人做事有数，算我欠你个人情。",
        "我之所以要找这工具箱，正是因为里面的重要物件。这青铜碎片，是2000年的事故留下来的，我兄弟龚泽就在这场事故中去世。我来这就是想继续调查，你有线索可以分享给我。"
      ],
      "choices": ["问问水质异常", "询问 2000 年的事故"],
      "effects": {
        "set_quest_stage": {"id": "gong_toolbox", "stage": 3},
        "remove_items": ["gong_toolbox"],
        "trigger_clues": ["gong_accident_investigation_opened"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gong_guided_stranger_reveal",
      "when": "manual",
      "once": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "quest_stage", "id": "gong_toolbox", "min": 2}
      ],
      "any_of": [
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_bronze_sample_suspected"},
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_rumor_was_planted"}
      ],
      "text": "龚泽电话里提过，带路的那个人连洞里有几道岔路都说得准。那人不是田原村的，熟悉洞里结构；事故以后附近还有人见过他，好像有个老大爷提供了目击线索。",
      "choices": ["追问带路者的特征", "询问山洞里的岔路"],
      "effects": {
        "trigger_clues": ["gong_guided_stranger_revealed"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gong_guilt_confession",
      "when": "manual",
      "once": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "affinity", "npc_id": "gong_zhong", "min": 2},
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_zes_death_questioned"}
      ],
      "pages": [
        "事故前一晚，龚泽问我要不要继续。我那时正气他欠债，告诉他都到洞口了，挖到东西老婆孩子就不用吃苦。第二天他死在里面。",
        "（龚忠低头翻动施工簿。）这笔账算到最后，总有我一份。"
      ],
      "choices": ["表示理解", "询问施工记录"],
      "effects": {
        "trigger_clues": ["gong_guilt_confession"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gong_desiccant_admission",
      "when": "manual",
      "once": true,
      "all_of": [
        {"type": "clue", "id": "gong_desiccant_experiment"}
      ],
      "text": "（龚忠摸了摸消退些的手背。）我离开村子几天，确实会好一些。来这四年，不是我胖了。干燥剂能压一阵，可压不住根子。要进山洞，我可以帮你把那段路修出来。",
      "choices": ["询问修路需要什么", "询问水源的影响"],
      "effects": {
        "trigger_clues": ["gong_water_anomaly_admitted"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "keywords": ["龚泽", "弟弟", "为什么调查", "为什么执着"],
      "affinity_delta": 1,
      "clue_id": "gong_zes_death_questioned",
      "min_disclosure_level": 1
    }
  ],
  "home_location": "construction_site",
  "current_location": "construction_site",
  "scene_hotspot": true,
  "portrait_small": "",
  "importance": "main",
  "sort_priority": 25,
  "mood_map": {
    "平静": "normal",
    "neutral": "normal",
    "thinking": "normal",
    "怀疑": "angry",
    "生气": "angry",
    "信任": "happy",
    "happy": "happy",
    "surprised": "angry",
    "疲惫": "sad",
    "weary": "sad"
  }
}
